# Blind attempt, third, for Silent Line: the first attempt's opening (which
# reached the garage ASSEMBLY screen by 6500), then circle three times to back
# out to the garage menu, cross on its first entry, and cross every 80 polls
# onwards. Frames every 300 polls from 6500 so the garage menus can be read.

drain 1500
minhold 4

  @100 tap start
  @200 tap circle
  @300 tap cross
  @400 tap start
  @500 tap circle
  @600 tap cross
  @700 tap start
  @800 tap circle
  @900 tap cross
  @1000 tap start
  @1100 tap circle
  @1200 tap cross
  @1300 tap start
  @1400 tap circle
  @1500 tap cross
  @1600 tap start
  @1700 tap circle
  @1800 tap cross
  @1900 tap start
  @2000 tap circle
  @2100 tap cross
  @2200 tap start
  @2300 tap circle
  @2400 tap cross
  @2500 tap start
  @2600 tap circle
  @2700 tap cross
  @2800 tap start
  @2900 tap circle
  mark "leave the option screen"
  @3000 tap circle
  @3080 tap circle
  @3160 tap down
  @3190 tap down
  @3220 tap down
  @3250 tap down
  @3280 tap down
  @3310 tap down
  @3360 tap cross
  mark "confirm onwards"
  @3440 tap cross
  @3520 tap cross
  @3600 tap cross
  @3680 tap cross
  @3760 tap cross
  @3840 tap cross
  @3920 tap cross
  @4000 tap circle
  @4080 tap cross
  @4160 tap cross
  @4240 tap cross
  @4320 tap cross
  @4400 tap cross
  @4480 tap cross
  @4560 tap cross
  @4640 tap cross
  @4720 tap cross
  @4800 tap cross
  @4880 tap cross
  @4960 tap cross
  @5040 tap cross
  @5120 tap cross
  @5200 tap cross
  @5280 tap cross
  @5360 tap cross
  @5440 tap cross
  @5520 tap cross
  @5600 tap cross
  @5680 tap cross
  @5760 tap cross
  @5840 tap cross
  @5920 tap cross
  @6000 tap circle
  @6080 tap cross
  @6160 tap cross
  @6240 tap cross
  @6320 tap cross
  @6400 tap cross
  @6480 tap cross
  mark "out of assembly, first garage entry, onwards"
  @6500 tap circle
  @6620 tap circle
  @6740 tap circle
  @6860 tap cross
  @6940 tap cross
  @7020 tap cross
  @7100 tap cross
  @7180 tap cross
  @7260 tap cross
  @7340 tap cross
  @7420 tap cross
  @7500 tap cross
  @7580 tap cross
  @7660 tap cross
  @7740 tap cross
  @7820 tap cross
  @7900 tap cross
  @7980 tap cross
  @8060 tap cross
  @8140 tap cross
  @8220 tap cross
  @8300 tap cross
  @8380 tap cross
  @8460 tap cross
  @8540 tap cross
  @8620 tap cross
  @8700 tap cross
  @8780 tap cross
  @8860 tap cross
  @8940 tap cross
  @9020 tap cross
  @9100 tap cross
  @9180 tap cross
  @9260 tap cross
  @9340 tap cross
  @9420 tap cross
  @9500 tap cross
  @9580 tap cross
  @9600 stop
